### 2. Universality Refactoring — What Changes

| Layer | Component | Before (v2.x) | After (v3.0.0) |
|-------|-----------|---------------|----------------|
| **Scripts** | eslint-audit.js | `'booking_system_refactor'` fallback | `throw Error('project_root not in config')` |
| **Scripts** | keystone-validate.js | `'booking_system_refactor'` fallback | `throw Error('project_root not in config')` |
| **Scripts** | code-quality-gate.js | `'booking_system_refactor'` + `booking-backend`/`booking-frontend` hardcoded | Reads `project.config.json` paths |
| **Hooks** | pre-commit (×2) | `INNER="$ROOT/booking_system_refactor"` | Reads `project.config.json project_root` |
| **Plugin** | eslint-plugin-booking-mock-audit | booking-specific name | `eslint-plugin-opencode-mock-audit` |
| **Agents** | architect.md | NestJS+Angular specific | Generic project architecture |
| **Agents** | coder-be.md / coder-fe.md | Hardcoded `booking-backend/src/` paths | `project.config.json agent_write_scopes` |
| **Agents** | guardian.md | Booking-specific review triggers | Config-driven triggers |
| **Rules** | dag-generation-standard.md | 11 modules, 4 families, min 49 tasks | Parameterized formulas |
| **Docs** | AGENTS.md | Mixed generic + booking | Split: AGENTS.md (generic) + PROJECT_REFERENCE.md |
| **Skills** | devops-ci-cd-guardrails | Booking-specific triggers | Config-driven triggers |
| **Skills** | Multiple | Booking examples | Placeholder-driven examples |
| **New** | project.template/ | [did not exist] | Scaffolding for new project adoption |
| **New** | PROJECT_TEMPLATE.md | [did not exist] | Adoption guide with checklist |
| **Cleanup** | SKILL.md.backup | Stale backup | Removed |
| **Cleanup** | Dormant skills | Untriaged | Audited + deprecated/removed |
| **Debt** | TECH-001 | chart palette sync | Repaid (deadline 2026-05-20) |

