### 6. Parallelization Strategy

**Wave 1 (P0, no dependencies)** — Launch simultaneously:
- UNIV-001 (@Coder-BE): Fix 3 JS files
- UNIV-002 (@Coder-BE): Fix 2 pre-commit hooks
- UNIV-003 (@Architect): Rename + refactor eslint plugin (12 files)

**Wave 2 (P0-P1, depends on Wave 1)** — Launch after Wave 1 completes:
- UNIV-004 (@Coder-BE): depends on UNIV-001
- UNIV-005 (@Architect): depends on UNIV-003
- UNIV-007 (@Architect): no deps — can start immediately
- UNIV-008 (@Meta-Planner): no deps — can start immediately

**Wave 3 (P1-P2)** — Depends on Wave 2:
- UNIV-006, UNIV-009: depend on UNIV-005
- UNIV-011: depends on UNIV-007
- UNIV-010: depends on UNIV-006

**Wave 4 (P2-P3)** — Depends on Wave 3:
- UNIV-012: depends on UNIV-009
- UNIV-013, UNIV-014, UNIV-016: independent, can start anytime

**Wave 5 (P3 + Gate)** — Final:
- UNIV-015: depends on UNIV-012
- UNIV-017 (Gate): depends on ALL 16 tasks

