### 8. Governance Preservation

All framework governance protocols are **preserved WITHOUT modification**:
- ✅ 3-layer 8-role multi-agent architecture
- ✅ Compliance gate (compliance_gate_check → confirm → complete)
- ✅ TDD iron law (RED → GREEN → REFACTOR)
- ✅ Contract-driven development (contract.yaml as single source of truth)
- ✅ Quality gates (@Guardian code review + test evidence verification)
