### 9. Framework Agnosticism Guarantees (Post v3.0.0)

| Guarantee | Verification |
|-----------|-------------|
| Zero hardcoded `booking_system_refactor` in scripts | `grep -r 'booking_system_refactor' .opencode/scripts/` → empty |
| Zero hardcoded `booking-backend`/`booking-frontend` in scripts | `grep -r 'booking-backend\|booking-frontend' .opencode/scripts/` → empty |
| Zero `booking-mock-audit` in .opencode/ | `grep -r 'booking-mock-audit' .opencode/` → empty |
| All script paths from project.config.json | Each script reads project_root from config |
| All agent paths from project.config.json | Each agent.md references config for write scopes |
| AGENTS.md is fully generic | Zero project-specific references |
| project.template/ exists | Directory with scaffolding |
| PROJECT_TEMPLATE.md exists | Adoption guide document |

